{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29171,"id":"156d2e7295b0169e"}||{"x":200,"y":515,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":10,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"初始化与使能\nPWM_EN=0，RELCON/ENCON=0。\nF_RESET 预置高，再置 CTRL_EN=1 并读反馈。\nPWM 停机保留 CTRL_EN=1。\nCTRL_EN=0 时 FPGA 反馈无效。\n切换 CTRL_EN 前先将 F_RESET 恢复空闲高。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":384,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29172,"id":"2a5eef36c154e635"}||{"x":200,"y":440,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":10,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"接口方向与供电\n按手册端子编号 1:1 插接。\nJ16 既定观察面左端 2上/1下。\nMBDL4 手册观察面右上1/右下2。\nJ1 底装配合方向按 PCB 针号；净高待配合检查。\nJ16 同时提供 3.3 V / 5 V 和数字地。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":385,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29300,"id":"fca18918243a968a"}||{"x":200,"y":365,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":10,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"使能与供电\n三颗 VCCA 接 J16 3.3 V，VCCB 接 J16 5 V。\nPWM_EN 高使能 U1，CTRL_EN 高使能 U2/U3。\nQ1/Q2 截止时，/OE 上拉默认禁止。\nCTRL_EN 为软件控制，独立核心 VCCO 掉电待实测。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":386,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":26048,"id":"e3faeff2dd686d9f"}||{"x":1365,"y":800,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":8,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"5 V 兼容样机\n参考 28335BPLUS 电平转换结构。\n六路 PWM 由 U1 直接驱动 MBDL4。\n保留原板 300 Ω、1 kΩ 和 Q7 电路。\n带载电平、光耦电流及关断状态待实测。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":387,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
