{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29174,"id":"31cf75b6f1718a7c"}||{"x":1120,"y":565,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":9,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"J2.25/26 为 MBDL4 控制侧 GND。\n+5V_B 仅由 J16 供电，与驱动板内部 5 V 分开。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1054,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29175,"id":"abec623cd38175fb"}||{"x":860,"y":1030,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":10,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"RELCON / ENCON 高有效，默认低。\n原板 R90=47 Ω 预充通路仍存在，继电器断开后母线仍有预充连接。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1055,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29176,"id":"a814c3022a38ff6b"}||{"x":860,"y":675,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":10,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"F_Reset 空闲高，原板 R106=5.1 kΩ 上拉。\n低→高上升沿清除 U21 故障锁存。\n清故障前 PWM_EN=0、ENCON/RELCON=0。\n消除故障原因后发复位边沿，再检查 ERRI/ERRU。\n清故障与 PWM 放行独立。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1056,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29177,"id":"cabb29894f7b250d"}||{"x":865,"y":285,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":10,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"ERRI / ERRU 为原板推挽、低有效锁存反馈。\nR23/R24 的 10 kΩ 下拉仅定义失驱偏置。\nQEP 两级 74HC14 相对跳线选中节点总体同相。\n完整编码器极性与边沿仍需按实际接线核验。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1057,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
{"type":"TEXT","ticket":29178,"id":"dd0358935c1ab7f6"}||{"x":1390,"y":500,"rotation":0,"color":null,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":9,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"现有焊盘测量点\n3.3 V  C10.1；5 V  C11.1；GND  C10.2\nOE_PWM_N  R13.2；OE_CTRL_N  R19.2\nF_RESET_B  J2.9\nERRI_B / ERRU_B  J2.19 / J2.20\n使用控制侧 GND 作测量参考。","fillColor":null,"zIndex":1058,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
